#: templates/home.html:19
msgid ""
"A reading room<br>\n"
"          for <em>papers</em> you<br>\n"
"          don&rsquo;t have time<br>\n"
"          to read."
msgstr ""
"O’qish xonasi —<br>\n"
"          o’qishga ulgurmagan<br>\n"
"          <em>maqolalaringiz</em><br>\n"
"          uchun."

#: templates/home.html:26
msgid ""
"Drop a PDF. Get back a five-section, academically faithful summary —\n"
"          abstract, key points, methodology, results, and conclusion — typeset\n"
"          like a magazine, ready in under thirty seconds."
msgstr ""
"PDFni tashlang. Beshta bo’limdan iborat, ilmiy jihatdan asoslangan xulosa —\n"
"          annotatsiya, asosiy tezislar, metodologiya, natijalar va xulosa — jurnal\n"
"          sahifasidek tartiblangan holda, o’ttiz soniyadan kam vaqt ichida tayyor bo’ladi."

