msgid ""
"&ldquo;Cut my literature review from three weeks to four evenings.\n"
"          The methodology section alone is worth it.&rdquo;"
msgstr ""
"«Adabiyotlar sharhimni uch haftadan to’rt kechalik ishga qisqartirdi.\n"
"          Faqat metodologiya bo’limining o’zi ham bunga arziydi.»"

