#: templates/home.html:84
msgid "Three steps. One PDF in, one summary out."
msgstr "Uch qadam. Bir PDF kiradi — bir xulosa chiqadi."

#: templates/home.html:91
msgid "[ 01 ] Drop"
msgstr "[ 01 ] Yuklash"

#: templates/home.html:92
msgid "A PDF, up to 50 MB."
msgstr "50 MB gacha bo’lgan PDF fayl."

#: templates/home.html:93
msgid ""
"English, Russian, or Uzbek. We extract the text, the figures' captions, and "
"the reference list."
msgstr ""
"Inglizcha, ruscha yoki o’zbekcha. Biz matnni, rasm tagliklarini va "
"adabiyotlar ro’yxatini ajratib olamiz."

#: templates/home.html:96
msgid "[ 02 ] Read"
msgstr "[ 02 ] O’qish"

#: templates/home.html:97
msgid "Llama 3.3 70B reads the paper."
msgstr "Maqolani Llama 3.3 70B o’qib chiqadi."

#: templates/home.html:98
msgid ""
"Served by Groq, the model returns a structured summary in roughly twenty "
"seconds — not minutes."
msgstr ""
"Groq infratuzilmasida ishlovchi model tuzilmali xulosani daqiqalarda emas, "
"taxminan yigirma soniyada qaytaradi."

#: templates/home.html:101
msgid "[ 03 ] Use"
msgstr "[ 03 ] Foydalanish"

#: templates/home.html:102
msgid "Read it, share it, export it."
msgstr "O’qing, ulashing, eksport qiling."

#: templates/home.html:103
msgid ""
"Browse the five sections, copy a public link, or export to PDF or Word for "
"your literature review."
msgstr ""
"Beshta bo’limni ko’rib chiqing, ommaviy havoladan nusxa oling yoki adabiyot "
"sharhi uchun PDF yoki Word formatiga eksport qiling."

#: templates/home.html:114
msgid "Every paper, the same shape"
msgstr "Har bir maqola — bir xil tuzilmada"

#: templates/home.html:115
msgid "Five sections. Always."
msgstr "Doimo beshta bo’lim."

